{"l":4138,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"o","variant":"reverse_meaning","q":"Hvad hedder 'måltid' på engelsk?","o":["menu","meal","plate","cook"],"a":"meal","r":"'Meal' er et måltid. Mel hedder 'flour'."},
{"l":4157,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'Yesterday it was Leo's turn to feed the fish, but he forgot. So his sister did it.' Hvem fodrede fiskene i går?","o":["Leo","Leos mor","Leos søster","ingen"],"a":"Leos søster","r":"Leo glemte det, så 'his sister did it'."},
{"l":4171,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'They ___ going to build a new school in our town.'","o":["is","be","do","are"],"a":"are","r":"'They' kræver 'are': 'they are going to'."},
{"l":4198,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad hedder 'hveps' på engelsk?","o":["wasp","wash","wisp","wrap"],"a":"wasp","r":"En hveps hedder 'wasp'."},
{"l":4228,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'Hurry up! We don't have ___ time.'","o":["many","much","few","lots"],"a":"much","r":"'Time' kan ikke tælles, så det hedder 'much time'."},
{"l":4247,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'How ___ sugar do you take in your tea?'","o":["many","lot","much","more"],"a":"much","r":"'Sugar' kan ikke tælles, så det hedder 'how much'."},
{"l":4278,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"o","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord betyder næsten det samme som 'photo' i 'Let's take a photo.'?","o":["painting","camera","poster","picture"],"a":"picture","r":"'Photo' og 'picture' kan begge betyde et billede. 'Camera' er det, man tager billedet med."},
{"l":4303,"g":6,"b":1,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"h","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad siger man på engelsk, når du har glemt dine lektier og skal forklare det til læreren?","o":["I'm sorry, I forgot my homework.","I'm sorry, I forgetted my homework.","I'm sorry, I have forget my homework.","I'm sorry, I forget my homework yesterday."],"a":"I'm sorry, I forgot my homework.","r":"Datid af 'forget' er 'forgot'."},
{"l":4339,"g":6,"b":1,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"h","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad siger man på engelsk, når du ringer til din ven, og hans mor tager telefonen?","o":["Hello, can I speak with Tom's, please?","Hello, can I speak to Tom, please?","Hello, may I talk Tom, please?","Hello, can I say to Tom, please?"],"a":"Hello, can I speak to Tom, please?","r":"I telefonen spørger man 'Can I speak to …, please?'."},
