{"l":4533,"g":6,"b":1,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'We ___ go swimming in winter. The water is too cold.'","o":["always","hardly ever","usually","often"],"a":"hardly ever","r":"Vandet er for koldt, så de bader næsten aldrig: 'hardly ever'."},
{"l":4571,"g":6,"b":1,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'My dad ___ forgets my birthday. He remembers it every year.'","o":["always","often","never","sometimes"],"a":"never","r":"Han husker den hvert år, så han glemmer den aldrig: 'never'."},
