{"l":4781,"g":6,"b":2,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'They were at the beach yesterday, ___ they?'","o":["didn't","wasn't","weren't","aren't"],"a":"weren't","r":"En positiv sætning med 'were' får spørgehalen 'weren't they?'."},
